cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ChartGenEval, please cite the software and accompanying paper."
title: "ChartGenEval: A Multi-Dimensional Metric Suite for Rhythm-Game Chart Generation"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-11
authors:
  - family-names: Lin
    given-names: Jhen-Ke
repository-code: "https://github.com/JacobLinCool/ChartGenEval"
url: "https://github.com/JacobLinCool/ChartGenEval"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A floor-first metric suite for rhythm-game chart generation: timing is
  measured against the official chart's authored timing map only, and six
  dimensions are scored separately with no overall total. Combines metrics
  proposed in the accompanying study with difficulty-conditioned adaptations
  of established chart statistics, plus controlled-corruption tools,
  calibration artifacts, and released per-chart evidence records.
